=3 Bonus Reward
* After turning in all eight correct pictures, zone and wait until JP Midnight again.
* When you speak to Balahaf, he says he remembers that he dropped some gold on his travels.
* Revisit every **???** location, and you will obtain an {i:Imperial Gold Piece|Imperial Gold Piece|2187} from one random location.
** Recommended order of travel from quickest location to get to, to slowest: 8, 1, 7, 5, 6, 2/3, 4
* Trade this {i:Imperial Gold Piece|Imperial Gold Piece|2187} to {n:Balakaf}. You will then receive it back, and you'll be allowed to flag the next quest {q:Five Seconds of Fame|Five Seconds of Fame|Five Seconds of Fame}.

